{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qQ54gZwKCj1795568297.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美股個別發展，AI股再跌拖累納指及費城半導體指數，道指上升；港股六連跌後料回穩，市場關注輝達、Anthropic、關稅及MLF消息。</p><p><strong>美股與港股</strong><br/>美股個別發展，AI股再跌，納指跌1%，費城半導體指數跌7%，標指跌0.5%，道指升423點。港股六連跌後料回穩。</p><p><strong>輝達與Anthropic</strong><br/>美國兩黨向輝達施壓，黃仁勳拒建立接班計劃。Anthropic跌穿招股價。</p><p><strong>關稅與MLF</strong><br/>美國據報擬提高中國、歐盟等關稅；中國MLF規模縮減。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T01:23:54.963956+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T00:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T22:50:07.963590+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T01:17:18.061175+00:00","content_hash":"91a11e106a22c51924e37c99de15dd672b0720da956edce58476a594c7122825","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T01:23:54.963956+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}